# ERP repository bootstrap

The workspace root is already:

`C:\Abhinav\ERP`

All files must be created inside this existing root.

Do not create a nested `erp/erp` or `ERP/ERP` folder.

This pass creates the engineering factory only:

- monorepo structure
- package manifests
- strict TypeScript configuration
- frontend/backend tooling
- PostgreSQL local environments
- testing configuration
