Do not implement ERP business functionality in this pass.

## Important frontend decision

The frontend UI library is **Material UI (MUI)**.

Do not install or use Tailwind CSS.

Do not use shadcn/ui.

Do not create Tailwind configuration.

Do not generate Tailwind utility classes.

Do not introduce another styling framework alongside MUI.

Use MUI as the primary design-system foundation.

The frontend architecture should be built around:

- `@mui/material`
- `@mui/icons-material`
- Emotion through MUI's default styling system
- MUI Theme
- MUI `sx`
- MUI `styled`
- reusable ERP-level components built on top of MUI

Prefer reusable theme configuration and component variants over repeatedly writing ad-hoc `sx` styling.

