# 13. Responsive UI architecture

Use MUI's responsive system.

Prefer responsive props and theme breakpoints.

Examples of future patterns:

```tsx
<Grid
  container
  spacing={2}
/>
```

and responsive MUI values such as:

```tsx
sx={{
  display: {
    xs: "block",
    md: "flex"
  }
}}
```

but avoid scattering repetitive responsive logic through every feature.

Repeated responsive patterns should become reusable layout abstractions inside `@erp/ui`.

Feature developers should primarily compose layout components rather than reinvent responsiveness.

