# 25. MUI-specific architecture enforcement

Cursor rules should explicitly prohibit:

- Tailwind utility classes
- Tailwind config
- shadcn/ui
- parallel CSS design systems
- arbitrary hardcoded visual values when theme tokens exist
- recreating MUI components without justification
- feature-specific copies of reusable UI primitives

