## Organization/company scope

ERP business persistence may later need:

```text
organizationId
companyId
branchId
```

The tenancy/company model must be decided before large numbers of business tables are introduced.

Do not add these fields yet.

## Idempotency

Externally retryable commands with meaningful side effects may require idempotency.

Examples include future:

- payment creation
- invoice posting
- stock movement
- webhook handling

Do not implement an idempotency framework yet.

